  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together soy sauce, brown sugar, garlic, peanut butter, lime juice, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add sirloin steak pieces to the marinade and mix well.",
    "Thread sirloin steak pieces, bell peppers, and onions onto skewers.",
    "Brush grill with vegetable oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, or until sirloin steak reaches an internal temperature of 145°F (63°C).",
    "Let skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve skewers with a side of steamed vegetables."
